a manager › AI model › See every rule — Settings → AI models: the rules for the organization, departments, roles, and agents.
a manager › AI model › AI tool — Automatic: the rules pick the AI tool and model, and say why. Or fix one for this agent.
a manager › AI model › Model — The model this AI tool runs for this agent.
a manager › AI model › Save AI tool and model — Keeps the AI tool and model chosen above for this agent.
a manager › AI model › Effort — How hard the model thinks before it answers. Changing it never hires a new agent.
a manager › AI model › Give it its own rule — Models, efforts, and AI companies for this agent alone; its rule comes before all others.
a manager › Work › Change permissions — Settings → Permissions: what each role may do, and each project's limit.
a manager › Team › Move to report to — Its whole team moves with it.
a manager › Team › Move — Makes it report to the one chosen above.
a manager › Team › Open the department's page — Its projects, people, and history on a page of its own.
a manager › Team › Edit department — Change its name, description, or whether it takes new projects.
a manager › Team › New project — Start a project in this department, with its supervisor.
a manager › Team › Archive department — Archives the department with its projects and people. You can bring it back.
a manager › Manage › Title — Unique within its team; teammates hand work to each other by title.
a manager › Manage › Rename — Keeps the new title. Its agent and conversation stay.
a manager › Manage › Hire into team — Add a position to its team: a new agent, or one from your Workforce.
a manager › Manage › Let agent go — Its agent retires and its conversation ends; the position stays, vacant.
a supervisor › Overview › Ask a question — A side chat: it answers from what it knows, and its work goes on.
a supervisor › Overview › Objective for Website Supervisor — Say what it should get done. It can hand parts of it to its team. Enter sends. Shift and Enter start a new line.
a supervisor › Overview › Give objective — Its agent starts on it now, in its first conversation.
a supervisor › Overview › Open its page — Its work, history, and permissions on a page of its own.
a supervisor › Job › Add your own specialty — Write a specialty of your own for the Supervisor role.
a supervisor › Job › This agent learns — Whether it writes down lessons from its work and gets its role's kept lessons.
a supervisor › Job › Supervisor agents learn — On or off for every Supervisor agent without a setting of its own.
a supervisor › Job › Learn on its own — On: this role's lessons are kept without asking you. Only lessons from tasks that used no tools are kept without you; the rest wait for your review.
a supervisor › AI model › See every rule — Settings → AI models: the rules for the organization, departments, roles, and agents.
a supervisor › AI model › AI tool — Automatic: the rules pick the AI tool and model, and say why. Or fix one for this agent.
a supervisor › AI model › Model — The model this AI tool runs for this agent.
a supervisor › AI model › Save AI tool and model — Keeps the AI tool and model chosen above for this agent.
a supervisor › AI model › Effort — How hard the model thinks before it answers. Changing it never hires a new agent.
a supervisor › AI model › Give it its own rule — Models, efforts, and AI companies for this agent alone; its rule comes before all others.
a supervisor › Work › Change permissions — Settings → Permissions: what each role may do, and each project's limit.
a supervisor › Team › Move to report to — Its whole team moves with it.
a supervisor › Team › Move — Makes it report to the one chosen above.
a supervisor › Team › End — End stops the assignment; the team no longer hands it work to check.
a supervisor › Team › Open the project's page — Its objectives, pull requests, and history on a page of its own.
a supervisor › Team › Edit project — Change its folder, repository, allowed AI tools, or permission limit.
a supervisor › Team › Archive project — Archives the project with its whole team. You can bring it back.
a supervisor › Manage › Title — Unique within its team; teammates hand work to each other by title.
