an archived agent › Job › Researcher agents learn — On or off for every Researcher agent without a setting of its own.
an archived agent › Job › Learn on its own — On: this role's lessons are kept without asking you. Only lessons from tasks that used no tools are kept without you; the rest wait for your review.
an archived agent › AI model › See every rule — Settings → AI models: the rules for the organization, departments, roles, and agents.
an archived agent › Work › Change permissions — Settings → Permissions: what each role may do, and each project's limit.
an archived agent › Manage › Bring back — Puts it back where it was, with all its settings. A full-time position gets a new agent.
an archived agent › Manage › Save to my Workforce — Keeps it with its settings, experience, and lessons, to hire again into any team.
an archived agent › Manage › Delete for good… — Asks first. It cannot be undone; a short record keeps its name on older work."
